From e4abf3fbc1241fb84adb4c640fab6cfd48b2ddeb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 08:19:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Nested logic: audit and implementation pass across the script
 engine
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

One structural condition walker (conditionWalk.ts) now drives renumbering,
canonicalisation, named-expression usage and survey-level lint, so every
condition field — including COUNT `where` — is covered by all of them.

Runtime fixes:
- grid row / column / whole-grid reads are cell sets ("any cell"), so
  `Q4.R1 > 23` on a numeric grid works (Oweas #7)
- constant sum `Q5.1 < 6 OR Q5.2 > 6` keeps each option's amount (Prince 44)
- same-page punch cascades through hidden questions, and a derived
  question's "always" punches are withdrawn when they stop holding (Prince 66)
- an EMPTY trigger (hide/exclude/prioritize when, validation check, probe
  stopWhen, loop skip/break/invalid, adaptive, quality rules) no longer fires
  for everyone — conditionFires()
- importer constants are real rules: FALSE no longer reads as TRUE
- COUNT `where` narrows every count; grid carry-forward carries ROWS, with a
  new per-column filter (29-09 #5, #6)
- randomizer visibleIf / eligible "show N", quota_check when, embedded field
  when, script when, UX behaviour when

Authoring:
- parser: && || ! <>, BUT NOT, COUNT where, positions, RHS refs, depth limits;
  printer round-trips all of them; ELSE IF prints as ELSE IF (Oweas #5)
- builder: root ALL/ANY/NONE + NOT, ungroup keeps NOT, Expression tab no
  longer rewrites on blur
- auto punch: numeric/text sources with value tests, nested Builder tab,
  edits keep chain mode and settings (29-09 #3, Prince 66)
- carry-forward editor offers only the source's own choices, with hints
  (Oweas 1-3, 6); editors for validation/list-rule/flow/script/behaviour
  conditions; "logic applied" markers ignore empty conditions (Oweas #4)
- unconditional skip / hide rules keep their behaviour and are now flagged
- copilot: structured conditions, conditional validation, branch arms
- references, renumber, dependencies, response filter, diagnose, lint,
  summary, import precedence, Word spec and datamap "Asked when"

Tests: engine nestedLogicAudit (S1-S20 + each sheet row), import, quality,
exporters, studio grammar, browser nested-logic-audit-test; mutation-checked.
Report: docs/NESTED-LOGIC-IMPLEMENTATION-2026-10-01.md

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QAcfUsJLu3R4pYxzaj9SU4
